'''Aerial Recon''' (空中偵察部隊, ''Kūchū Teisatsu Butai'', '''Aerial Recon Unit''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Research Power UP (M): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 52 frames (1.73 sec).

